            description: Some("Attaches one or more Lightsail instances to a load balancer. After some time, the instances are attached to the load balancer and the health check status is available. The attach instances to load balancer operation supports tag-based access control via resource tags applied to the resource identified by load balancer name. For more information, see the Lightsail Developer Guide"),
