                    description: Some("A Boolean value to indicate whether to use the latest available automatic snapshot of the specified source instance or disk. Constraints:   This parameter cannot be defined together with the restore date parameter. The use latest restorable auto snapshot and restore date parameters are mutually exclusive.   Define this parameter only when copying an automatic snapshot as a manual snapshot. For more information, see the Amazon Lightsail Developer Guide"),
                ),
                (
                    names: [
